WEBVTT

00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:03.910
Now let's connect your scan to the correct shoot with
R/E Pro Photos.

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:08.915
Once the order is in Draft, open the CubiCasa app with
an account that can access your team's

00:00:08.920 --> 00:00:11.190
orders. Open Orders and choose Draft.

00:00:13.047 --> 00:00:16.337
Find your property and check the address against the
assigned shoot.

00:00:16.587 --> 00:00:19.597
Check the shoot ID when shown, then open the matching
draft.

00:00:19.947 --> 00:00:24.942
If the order is missing or incorrect, contact the R/E
Pro Photos team before creating

00:00:24.947 --> 00:00:25.677
another order.

00:00:26.680 --> 00:00:31.135
For a new scan, start from that draft order and follow
the scanning instructions you just

00:00:31.140 --> 00:00:35.435
watched. Cover the full property, then review your
scan and the app's feedback before

00:00:35.440 --> 00:00:35.990
continuing.

00:00:37.047 --> 00:00:41.177
If you've already captured the property, open its
draft and choose Attach Scan.

00:00:41.527 --> 00:00:43.777
Select the matching scan saved on this phone.

00:00:43.927 --> 00:00:46.397
Check carefully that the scan belongs to this address.

00:00:47.413 --> 00:00:50.383
Review the address and scan, then check the package.

00:00:50.793 --> 00:00:52.783
Draft orders may open with Lite selected.

00:00:53.013 --> 00:00:56.303
Change it to Plus and confirm Plus is selected before
continuing.

00:00:56.613 --> 00:01:00.563
Then choose Send for Processing and complete any
confirmation shown in the app.

00:01:01.447 --> 00:01:05.497
Use a stable internet connection and keep the app open
until the upload finishes.

00:01:05.887 --> 00:01:08.417
If it fails, check the connection and retry.

00:01:08.687 --> 00:01:11.197
Confirm the order has moved out of Draft before
leaving.

00:01:12.213 --> 00:01:14.583
CubiCasa processes the submitted scan.

00:01:14.933 --> 00:01:19.863
Once the order is ready, R/E Pro Photos can sync the
finished floor plans to the linked shoot.

00:01:20.053 --> 00:01:24.423
Check the shoot in R/E Pro Photos, and contact the
team if the plans are missing.

00:01:24.733 --> 00:01:28.483
Remember: match the draft, scan or attach, then
submit.

